# Leave EMPTY (recommended). The app then calls its own site at /api/..., which vercel.json forwards to the backend.
# That avoids browser CORS blocks (Zoho Catalyst's gateway answers CORS preflight itself, without CORS headers).
# Only set a full URL (no trailing slash) to talk to a backend that is configured for cross-origin browser calls.
# (VITE_API_URL is no longer used: delete it from Vercel if it is still set.)
# Must equal the backend's WEB_API_TOKEN. Anything in VITE_* is public in the built JS: prefer entering it in the app.
# VITE_API_TOKEN=
